LOCUS       example_vRNA_bc_H1      1944 bp    ss-RNA  linear   SYN 15-SEP-2026
DEFINITION  Example barcoded influenza vRNA segment carrying the H1 HA from
            A/Missouri/11/2025 with the barcode of GAGTACTCTGCGTTTT, presented
            in mRNA sense. Runs from the 3' NCR (U12) through the 5' NCR (U13),
            inclusive. Carries a WSN signal peptide and endodomain, a
            16-nucleotide barcode, an Illumina Read1 sequence, and a duplicated
            WSN packaging signal.
ACCESSION   .
VERSION     .
KEYWORDS    .
SOURCE      synthetic DNA construct
  ORGANISM  synthetic DNA construct
            .
